{"about_the_game":"Inspired by the Half-Life series, Estranged: Arctic Cold follows the story of a fisherman stranded in a mysterious Arctic facility. Experience the rich environments and captivating storytelling as you venture deeper into the facility.<br><br>A standalone sequel to <i>Estranged: Act I (2014)</i> and <i>Estranged: The Departure (2020)</i> continues the story of a shipwrecked fisherman, uncovering the secretive Arque Corporation, burrowing ever deeper into their dangerous and haphazard operations in the Arctic Cold.<br><br><strong>Product Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Original single player experience:</strong> Inspired by the Half-Life series, the game features an interactive world with player physics interaction.<br></li><li><strong>Intriguing story:</strong> An original story featuring a captivating world and absorbing characters.<br></li><li><strong>Unfinished sequel:</strong> A standalone sequel to <i>The Departure</i>, which also gained new content via periodic updates incorporating community feedback until it was finished.</li></ul><br><i>This game is developed by one person in their spare time, with help from a community of translators and testers. It is a standalone sequel to Estranged: The Departure (2020) which followed our hero's adventure in a search for a way to get home.</i>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1347230?t=1770848817","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1347230?t=1770848817","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1347230/1f12fd80cab7fbc832a1b18b41663ea138be3c78/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770848817","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1347230/1f12fd80cab7fbc832a1b18b41663ea138be3c78/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770848817","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},